WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:03.500
Your son... does indeed share some personal acquaintance with him.

00:04.320 --> 00:11.880
A sanctimonious pedant! As if only he has a righteous mouth, as if only he cares for the people! Eating my imperial grain, yet cursing heaven and earth—he even dares curse me!

00:11.920 --> 00:16.560
A fool rushing toward his own grave... and you managed to get tangled up with the likes of him?!

00:16.800 --> 00:18.500
Your son trembles in fear!
